. Travel amongst them, learn new spells, and uncover the secrets of this strange world to orchestrate your escape.","steam_appid":1024850,"support_info":{"email":"flowweaver@stitch.media","url":"https://www.gamesbystitch.com/games/flowweaver"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.gamesbystitch.com/games/flowweaver"}